ap-3 mb-3"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-info-circle text-white text-xs"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">What is EN 15224?</h4></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">EN 15224:2016 is a European quality-management standard for healthcare organisations. It is based on ISO 9001 and adds healthcare-specific requirements, including clinical risk, patient safety, continuity of care and the needs of patients and service users. It is a management-system standard, not a clinical guideline or a substitute for health laws and professional duties.</p></div></div><div class="lg:col-span-2 relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-slate-100 h-[320px] md:h-[400px] group"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367531/eurocert/m18.png.png" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105" alt="EN 15224 Healthcare Quality"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-900/20 via-transparent to-transparent"></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Our Services</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">EN 15224 <span class="text-euro-600">Services</span></h2></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5 max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-shield-alt text-